stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Cold
    Cold --> Preparing: Open or focused-screen preload
    Preparing --> Moving: Reveal or camera starts
    Moving --> Preparing: Camera and reveal reach destination
    Preparing --> Settled: Layout warmup completes
    Settled --> Moving: Ascend, descend or close
    Settled --> Preparing: Structural source change while visible
    Settled --> Cached: Surface closes in normal mode
    Cached --> Moving: Reopen
    Cached --> Cold: Performance mode releases scene
    note right of Moving
        Pause simulation and warmup.
        Coalesce source and resize updates.
    end note
    note right of Preparing
        Incubate node visuals asynchronously.
        Bound each warmup batch to four steps / 4 ms.
        Resume queued source and resize updates.
    end note
    note right of Cached
        Keep scene objects and settled positions.
        Defer structural updates until arrival.
    end note
